# Controls Package Rules

## Hard rules

- Zero `.axaml` files in this package
- No service locator; controls must not resolve DI services
- No business logic or ViewModel assumptions

## New control checklist

1. Single responsibility — see `04-control-design.mdc`
2. Class in `Controls/{Domain}/` — inherit `RegionControl`, `TemplatedControl`, etc.
3. Pseudo-classes via `PseudoClassName` constants + `Property.Changed.AddClassHandler`
4. `[TemplatePart("PART_*", typeof(...))]` for each template part
5. Theme: `Theme.Controls/Custom/{Name}.axaml` with `x:Key="{x:Type my:Name}"`
6. Register in `Custom/_index.axaml`
7. Showcase page + headless test

## Property pattern (mandatory)

```csharp
public static readonly StyledProperty<T> XProperty =
    AvaloniaProperty.Register<MyControl, T>(nameof(X));

public T X
{
    get => GetValue(XProperty);
    set => SetValue(XProperty, value);
}
```

## DirectProperty

Only when performance-critical or styling is not required.

## Lifecycle

Use `OnApplyTemplate`, `OnAttachedToVisualTree`, `OnDetachedFromVisualTree`.
Unsubscribe all events and observables on detach.
